10
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:26,000
The Mortuary Assistant is an upcoming American supernatural horror film directed by
Jeremiah Kipp from a screenplay by Tracee Beebe and Brian Clarke.

11
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Based on the 2022 video game by DreadXP, it stars Willa Holland and Paul Sparks.

